# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization. eol=lf is required
# beyond normalization: `git archive` overlays follow the checkout conversion,
# so with core.autocrlf=true on Windows an eol-less text file exports as CRLF
# and lands CRLF on the Linux boxes (2026-10-18: CRLF-ified wgkernel compose).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
